WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:07,950
Pei Guoping, you are so brave, how can you talk to Miss Youyou?

2
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:12,240
Su Boren actually dared to call me by my name?

3
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,240
Apologize to Miss Youyou quickly!

4
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:21,150
Berlin, do you know what you're talking about?

5
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:24,150
You ask an elder to apologize to a junior!

6
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,150
Don't be idle and apologize!

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:33,420
The Tao is against the Tiangang, this is purely the Tao against the Tiangang!

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:36,420
Your Su family is so deceptive!

9
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,420
Madam, Jiaojiao, let’s go!

10
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:43,020
Does Brother Ri still need the Lu family’s life?

11
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:45,020
Jiaojiao is still too kind

12
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:50,330
Son, why did you get off the car?

13
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:54,330
Su Chen hasn't even opened his eyes in the past few days, but now he can actually open the door

14
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:57,330
Could it be that the light has returned?

15
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:59,940
Brother Jiao, let me help you!

16
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:08,530
Accompany uncle

17
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:10,530
Brother Jiao, I'm here!

18
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:24,720
I'm not your uncle!
